        <p>For the modest sum of Sixteen Shillings and Elevenpence we can Offer you a Suit or Overcoat which, in the long-run, will con- vince you that your money has been well spent. Spring is coming and we must clear all our present stock of Cloths and Window Models in order• to make room for some of the choicest designs that will be seen during the coming Season. We have hundreds of testimonials from satisfied customers; the following is one which came to hand last week. Derby, Jan. 29th, 1915. Kellett's, St. Peter's Street, Derby. "Gentlemen, Just a word in praise of your 16/11 suits to measure. I am wearing one at the present time which was purchased four years ago, and it is all that could be desired—Style, Fit, and Wearing qualities combined—and what is more —right in price; in fact, they are equal to suits I have had from other shops at twice the price. —Yours truly, (Signed) S.P." The original letter may be seen with pleasure. £lOO will be given to any Charity if our statement can be proved inaccurate. We want all our customers to avail themselves of this exceptional offer. SUITS or OVERCOATS 16/11</p>
